# --- Build artefacts and caches we never want in the image ---
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.cache

# --- Local secrets / data — must never enter an image ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/dev.db
**/dev.db-journal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# --- VCS / IDE / OS ---
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Tests / docs not needed at runtime ---
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/__tests__
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/test-plan.md
**/test-report.md

# --- Vercel artifacts (we deploy to K8s) ---
.vercel
vercel.json

# --- Local docker / k8s manifests don't go inside the image itself ---
docker-compose*.yml
k8s/
docs/
HANDOFF.md
HANDOVER.md
README.md
